# @mnb/tokens

Read `packages/tokens/.instructions.md`. The live theme is `src/variables.css`.

Add a custom property there as `--mnb-name`, then use `var(--mnb-name)`. Do not invent a second palette. `DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` is the old mint/pink theme.
